# notecode - what does not go into the repository.
#
# Three things are kept out: anything that could be a credential, the model
# weights (tens of gigabytes), and the machine state that belongs to one
# computer rather than to the project.
#
# The .md rule is the surprising one. Markdown is ignored, because this
# project accumulates a lot of it while it works - notes, plans, findings,
# scratch files in the workspace. The files the app itself binds are kept:
# the skills it installs and the project's own agents.md.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- credentials
# Nothing that could be a key, a token or a password.
.env
.env.*
*.env
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
*.secret
*_rsa
*_dsa
*_ed25519
id_rsa*
id_dsa*
id_ed25519*
secrets.json
secrets.local.json
credentials.json
settings.local.json
config.local.json
*.user

# The provider store holds the API tokens, encrypted with DPAPI for the
# user's Windows account. The presets in it are not secret, but the file is
# machine state and is written by the app, so it is never committed.
runtime/providers.json

# The MCP server list can carry a key in a command line.
runtime/mcp-servers.local.json

# -------------------------------------------------------------------- models
# The weights live on the machine, not in the repository. A Q4 model of this
# size is 17 GB and there is no version control that wants that.
*.gguf
*.ggml
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
models/

# -------------------------------------------------------------- build output
bin/
obj/
dist/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
*.user
*.suo
*.VC.db
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
TestResults/
installer/build/
installer/output/
installer/stage/
installer/payload.zip
*.apk
*.aab

# -------------------------------------------------------------- machine state
# Written by the app while it runs, and true of one computer only.
runtime/*.log
runtime/*.log.*
runtime/*.pid
runtime/app-requests.jsonl
runtime/open-queue.jsonl
runtime/app-results/
runtime/app-context.json
runtime/notecode-app.log
runtime/llama-server.log
runtime/llama-server.log.err
runtime/mcp-trace.log
runtime/notecode-server.log

# ----------------------------------------------------------------- test litter
# The workspace is where the tests write, and the findings are evidence for
# a run rather than part of the project.
workspace/
rea/findings/
assets/preview/
assets/_*
# Scratch folders for a throwaway probe.
.tmp-*/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- markdown
# Ignored, with the files the app binds kept.
*.md
!**/SKILL.md
!**/agents.md
!/README.md
!/docs/*.md
!/finalAudit.md

# --------------------------------------------------------------------- macOS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
